WEBVTT

00:00:01.790 --> 00:00:03.790
Salutations, everyone!

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:07.540
It's me, Shami- I mean, Shadow Mistress Yuko!

00:00:07.830 --> 00:00:11.660
A few days ago, somehow or another
I ended up taking lessons from Momo

00:00:11.660 --> 00:00:15.120
to learn how to use projectiles
and she really put me through the grinder!

00:00:15.450 --> 00:00:20.250
A lot of things led up to it, but I went with Momo
to an abandoned factory that she owns

00:00:20.250 --> 00:00:22.540
and that's where my training began.

00:00:22.540 --> 00:00:23.950
I was totally thrown for a loop!

00:00:24.290 --> 00:00:29.910
Momo was so gung-ho about it, she made the training
extra hard and it left me super sore and frazzled!

00:00:30.080 --> 00:00:34.750
Thanks to her and the motivation of 100% beef for dinner,
I was able to shoot out some of my own magic.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:41.700
But it was too weak, so the magic just came back at me
and it hurt as bad as an intramuscular injection?

00:00:41.910 --> 00:00:43.200
Major ouchies...

00:00:51.950 --> 00:00:53.750
Hallelujah, amen.

00:00:54.580 --> 00:00:55.870
What are you doing?

00:00:56.290 --> 00:00:57.250
Making an offering!

00:00:57.250 --> 00:01:06.250
CLASSIC
MILD
TEA

00:00:57.910 --> 00:01:01.500
This is a statue of my ancestor who was sealed away,
the founder of the Dark Clan!

00:01:01.500 --> 00:01:02.370
Oh?

00:01:02.370 --> 00:01:06.250
I was told to leave some delicious treats
and magazines as offerings.

00:01:07.040 --> 00:01:10.160
Shamiko! We brought some offerings, too!

00:01:10.160 --> 00:01:13.290
I found a nice little something after looking around.

00:01:13.330 --> 00:01:17.700
CLASSIC
MILD
TEA

00:01:13.660 --> 00:01:15.290
I hope your ancestor enjoys it.

00:01:15.290 --> 00:01:17.660
As you can see, everyone is helping me out!

00:01:17.830 --> 00:01:20.330
She's been making a lot of offerings lately.

00:01:20.330 --> 00:01:22.500
So that's why you always carry that around with you.

00:01:22.750 --> 00:01:25.790
Oh right, I hadn't explained any of this to you yet.

00:01:25.790 --> 00:01:27.000
I see.

00:01:27.000 --> 00:01:31.410
All this time I thought it was just some rock
you scavenged to add extra weight on yourself.

00:01:31.410 --> 00:01:33.160
I was impressed you would train like that.

00:01:33.160 --> 00:01:35.790
I didn't scavenge it and it's not for training!

00:01:36.080 --> 00:01:36.750
TEA

00:01:36.700 --> 00:01:39.870
The magic it gives off is really weak,
I can hardly even sense it.

00:01:39.870 --> 00:01:42.700
I think it weighs about 2 pounds.

00:01:42.700 --> 00:01:44.830
Don't use it as a research subject!

00:01:45.290 --> 00:01:45.950
Huh?

00:01:46.250 --> 00:01:48.290
What's this on the bottom, Shamiko?

00:01:49.290 --> 00:01:50.500
A switch...?

00:01:51.040 --> 00:01:51.830
Why?

00:01:52.330 --> 00:01:57.870
This is the tale of an incompetent Demon Girl
who gets bamboozled and falls into the debt of her rival,

00:01:57.870 --> 00:02:01.500
while also learning to grow and mature as a person.

00:02:01.500 --> 00:02:03.410
Or something to that effect.

00:02:14.910 --> 00:02:17.540
The Demon Girl Next Door

00:03:34.000 --> 00:03:39.000
Sharpen Your Mind!!
The Newly Awakened Powers of the Magical Girl

00:03:43.580 --> 00:03:46.080
Ms. Sata and Ms. Ogura, would you mind stepping back?

00:03:44.120 --> 00:03:46.790
I never realized that there
was a switch on the bottom of it...

00:03:46.080 --> 00:03:46.790
Sure thing.

00:03:46.790 --> 00:03:47.750
Just call me "Anri."

00:03:49.750 --> 00:03:51.450
Did you just flip it on without warning?!

00:03:51.450 --> 00:03:53.120
Why would you do that?!

00:03:53.120 --> 00:03:56.040
There's no one else in the classroom right now.

00:03:56.040 --> 00:03:58.830
And if there's some sort of evil gimmick built in,
then the safest place to test it is a place where

00:03:58.830 --> 00:04:00.830
I can deal with it if necessary.

00:04:01.160 --> 00:04:05.000
What were you planning to do
if an ogre or a snake popped out of it?

00:04:05.000 --> 00:04:07.830
I would obliterate it into nothing.
Then we could just forget about it.

00:04:07.830 --> 00:04:08.910
Ruthless!

00:04:09.120 --> 00:04:11.290
It might be a secret weapon meant for me...

00:04:13.500 --> 00:04:14.910
But... now...

00:04:16.410 --> 00:04:17.580
Shamiko?!

00:04:19.120 --> 00:04:20.370
Don't tell me...

00:04:20.950 --> 00:04:22.540
She was finally reduced to eating off the street?!

00:04:22.540 --> 00:04:24.660
I think you've totally got the wrong idea.

00:04:24.660 --> 00:04:27.200
Even Shamiko wouldn't go that far, you know!

00:04:27.200 --> 00:04:29.250
Is it safe to join you over there now?

00:04:30.370 --> 00:04:31.370
Ah!

00:04:34.000 --> 00:04:34.950
Huh?

00:04:35.120 --> 00:04:38.080
I felt my consciousness slip away really fast and then...

00:04:39.000 --> 00:04:40.450
Where am I?

00:04:40.830 --> 00:04:42.080
Am I dreaming?

00:04:42.080 --> 00:04:43.250
Who goes there?

00:04:43.250 --> 00:04:44.450
I know that voice!

00:04:48.450 --> 00:04:50.370
Oh... long time, no see.

00:04:50.370 --> 00:04:52.000
My ancestor is in lounge mode.

00:04:52.290 --> 00:04:54.540
Oh it's just you, Yuko?

00:04:54.540 --> 00:04:56.500
Would you mind waiting just a moment?

00:04:56.500 --> 00:04:57.290
Sure.

00:04:57.290 --> 00:04:59.700
Shuffle. Shuffle. Shuffle. Shuffle.

00:04:57.330 --> 00:04:57.580
Shuffle

00:04:57.580 --> 00:04:57.790
Shuffle

00:04:57.790 --> 00:04:58.000
Shuffle

00:04:58.000 --> 00:04:58.160
Shuffle

00:04:58.160 --> 00:04:58.330
Shuffle

00:04:58.330 --> 00:04:58.540
Shuffle

00:04:58.540 --> 00:04:58.700
Shuffle

00:04:58.700 --> 00:04:58.910
Shuffle

00:04:58.910 --> 00:04:59.080
Shuffle

00:04:59.080 --> 00:04:59.250
Shuffle

00:04:59.250 --> 00:04:59.410
Shuffle

00:04:59.410 --> 00:04:59.580
Shuffle

00:04:59.700 --> 00:05:00.040
Shuffle

00:05:00.040 --> 00:05:00.330
Shuffle

00:05:00.330 --> 00:05:00.660
Shuffle

00:05:00.660 --> 00:05:01.000
Shuffle

00:05:01.000 --> 00:05:01.330
Shuffle

00:05:02.160 --> 00:05:03.620
Heave-ho!

00:05:03.750 --> 00:05:04.750
Oh crap, my belt!

00:05:05.700 --> 00:05:07.120
I guess I don't need the shoes!

00:05:07.330 --> 00:05:08.910
Well then, my cute little descendant...

00:05:09.330 --> 00:05:11.540
GLIMMER
GLIMMER

00:05:09.450 --> 00:05:11.910
...welcome to the sealed space within my statue!

00:05:14.330 --> 00:05:16.370
I'll help you find the rest of your outfit.

00:05:16.370 --> 00:05:18.660
Forget it! This is just my sense of fashion!

00:05:18.830 --> 00:05:22.620
But you're one to talk,
what is that gaudy thing you've put my statue in?!

00:05:22.620 --> 00:05:29.620
CLASSIC
MILD
TEA

00:05:23.200 --> 00:05:24.500
It came free with a bottle of tea.

00:05:24.500 --> 00:05:26.620
The statue of your ancestors
should be revered and respected!

00:05:26.620 --> 00:05:29.620
Where is your sense of dignity?!
This is so uncool it hurts to look at!

00:05:29.750 --> 00:05:35.290
B-but, it's my absolute favorite bag
and the softest one I own!

00:05:37.160 --> 00:05:39.290
I dropped the statue the first time I took it outside...

00:05:39.870 --> 00:05:41.410
...and I felt so bad about it!

00:05:41.410 --> 00:05:43.790
But if you think the bag is uncool, then...

00:05:42.700 --> 00:05:43.790
It's your favorite...?

00:05:44.200 --> 00:05:45.200
Yes!

00:05:46.250 --> 00:05:48.790
I was just kidding! That bag is just fine!

00:05:48.790 --> 00:05:52.370
Thinking about it, this symbol makes it look
super cute and eco-friendly!

00:05:49.040 --> 00:05:52.000
TEA

00:05:52.620 --> 00:05:56.290
Or, you know, you could just wrap it up in a towel
that you're not going to use anymore!

00:05:56.580 --> 00:06:00.000
What a relief! I'm so glad you like it, too!

00:06:00.000 --> 00:06:01.000
Totally!

00:06:02.870 --> 00:06:03.870
Anyway...

00:06:04.160 --> 00:06:08.540
The fact you were able to come here
means that you've met all the requirements.

00:06:08.540 --> 00:06:09.700
"Requirements"?

00:06:09.700 --> 00:06:10.330
Yep!

00:06:10.330 --> 00:06:13.290
A moderate signal

00:06:10.790 --> 00:06:13.290
Step 1: A moderate signal!

00:06:13.290 --> 00:06:16.250
Good Weather

00:06:13.790 --> 00:06:16.200
Step 2: Good weather!

00:06:16.250 --> 00:06:19.700
The perfect amount of calories per offering
WALKING SHARK ZOMBIES
SEASON 3
PLAIN YOGURT

00:06:16.500 --> 00:06:19.660
Step 3: The perfect amount of calories per offering!

00:06:19.790 --> 00:06:22.620
And also... flipping the ancestor switch on!

00:06:22.750 --> 00:06:24.700
When all of those requirements are met,

00:06:24.700 --> 00:06:27.950
it enables me to borrow the body of a descendent
and wage our war in their place!

00:06:28.200 --> 00:06:29.910
Wh-whaaat?!

00:06:29.910 --> 00:06:32.290
This'll be my first outing in a long time!

00:06:32.290 --> 00:06:34.660
Then what am I supposed to do in the meantime?!

00:06:34.660 --> 00:06:38.160
Take a seat under the kotatsu
and just relax here for a while!

00:06:44.410 --> 00:06:47.290
Whoa... she's out cold, but her eyes are still open.

00:06:47.290 --> 00:06:50.580
It's almost like her soul is missing, I hope she's all right.

00:06:53.870 --> 00:06:55.160
Get back, you two!

00:07:00.250 --> 00:07:03.950
It's been some time
since I last felt the wind across my skin.

00:07:04.750 --> 00:07:06.950
This aura is different... she's not Shamiko!

00:07:08.620 --> 00:07:09.790
Indeed!

00:07:09.790 --> 00:07:13.410
I am the witch who governs
over the eternal powers of darkness! Lilith!

00:07:13.410 --> 00:07:17.370
I've supplanted the soul of my descendant
to borrow their body and slaughter a Magical Girl!

00:07:19.540 --> 00:07:24.330
I'm Shami! I mean, I'm the great ascendant
of Shadow Mistress Yuko!

00:07:24.330 --> 00:07:25.910
Shamiko's "ascendant"...?

00:07:26.290 --> 00:07:27.080
So, "Shami-cen"?

00:07:27.080 --> 00:07:28.950
Hey, don't give me any corny nicknames!

00:07:28.950 --> 00:07:32.580
Momo Chiyoda! I know all about you!

00:07:36.620 --> 00:07:38.410
Don't think so highly of yourself!

00:07:38.410 --> 00:07:41.580
I've watched you bully my adorable little descendant
and I'm going to make you pay for it!

00:07:41.580 --> 00:07:47.160
Um, although her presence has made Shamiko cry
before, Momochiyo has never actually bullied her.

00:07:47.620 --> 00:07:51.080
In fact, I would say that she's helped Shamiko grow.
She even baited her with food.

00:07:51.080 --> 00:07:53.370
Shamiko has actually started to look healthier lately.

00:07:53.370 --> 00:07:55.160
O-oh, is that so?

00:07:55.160 --> 00:07:57.250
You have my thanks for that, then.

00:07:57.540 --> 00:07:58.500
Shami-

00:07:59.080 --> 00:08:02.580
I mean, I also owe you for saving
Shadow Mistress Yuko from that dump truck!

00:08:02.580 --> 00:08:04.620
In honor of that I'll make sure you die
without any suffering!

00:08:04.620 --> 00:08:08.200
"Shadow Mistress" is pretty tough to say
without flubbing up, right?

00:08:06.370 --> 00:08:07.080
Snicker.

00:08:06.620 --> 00:08:07.450
Snicker

00:08:08.200 --> 00:08:10.700
I changed my mind!
I'm definitely going to grind you into dust!

00:08:12.660 --> 00:08:16.950
You may think you have it easy right now,
but soon your face will be twisted in unbearable pain!

00:08:17.620 --> 00:08:18.910
Whaddya doing?!

00:08:18.910 --> 00:08:20.750
I'm worried that you're going to fall.

00:08:20.750 --> 00:08:23.700
I-I won't fall! Even if I did, I certainly don't need your help!

00:08:22.120 --> 00:08:23.700
Just ignore me and keep giving your speech.

00:08:23.700 --> 00:08:25.830
And don't pretend it's so easy
to slip through my defenses!

00:08:25.830 --> 00:08:28.500
Huh?! Even though you're
pretty much totally unguarded?

00:08:28.700 --> 00:08:30.750
I'm sorry, I should have been more sensitive about it.

00:08:30.750 --> 00:08:33.120
Okay, that's it! This means war!

00:08:34.790 --> 00:08:37.410
Oh wow, this has all the broadcast channels.

00:08:37.750 --> 00:08:40.700
But nothing good is on right now...

00:08:40.950 --> 00:08:43.290
Are you ready to say your prayers?

00:08:46.450 --> 00:08:50.830
When the seal is finally broken,
I will ride the local bus to every nearby hot spring,

00:08:50.790 --> 00:08:53.040
Madam Lilith!
This is a famous hot spring!

00:08:50.830 --> 00:08:53.040
and enjoy them all to my heart's content!

00:08:53.160 --> 00:08:57.000
Then after that, I'll just conquer the entire world
whenever the time seems right!

00:08:57.500 --> 00:09:01.750
I think you should come up with a more meticulous plan
for that second half while you have the chance.

00:09:01.750 --> 00:09:04.410
You're really starting to get on my nerves!

00:09:04.500 --> 00:09:05.580
Let our battle begin!

00:09:06.040 --> 00:09:09.870
Hiyaaaah!

00:09:10.330 --> 00:09:12.040
What the...? How is it THIS heavy?!

00:09:18.750 --> 00:09:22.250
This is amazing! You can play
with the console we have at home in here!

00:09:22.870 --> 00:09:26.950
Time out for a sec. I totally have an invincible barrier up
right now, so don't attack okay?

00:09:27.580 --> 00:09:28.700
Uh, okay.

00:09:28.700 --> 00:09:30.660
Wh-what is wrong with this body?

00:09:30.660 --> 00:09:33.500
I barely even move and it feels like
my balance is totally thrown off.

00:09:33.950 --> 00:09:35.370
Not to mention I run out of breath!

00:09:35.370 --> 00:09:38.830
It's hard to summon any real strength,
and my neck and shoulders feel way too stiff!

00:09:38.830 --> 00:09:40.620
Plus my vision seems more than a little blurry!

00:09:40.620 --> 00:09:41.910
Um, Ms. Lilith?

00:09:41.910 --> 00:09:47.330
I think that body can't keep up with all the movements
that you're attempting to perform.

00:09:47.910 --> 00:09:50.120
Does that mean this body is an absolute hunk of junk?!

00:09:50.910 --> 00:09:52.790
No, uh...

00:09:53.200 --> 00:09:58.750
I would say it has reflexes that are hard to ignore
and is currently dealing with a lot of stress...

00:09:58.750 --> 00:09:59.580
So, uh....

00:09:59.580 --> 00:10:01.750
Your awkward explanations never help!

00:10:01.750 --> 00:10:04.410
Fine, then I'll just have to beat you with magic!

00:10:07.950 --> 00:10:12.410
Huh? Why is it coming back at- OW!

00:10:12.870 --> 00:10:15.000
Hey, you commoners! No laughing!

00:10:15.790 --> 00:10:18.660
I'm not... laughing... at all...

00:10:18.950 --> 00:10:20.290
I can hear you doing it!

00:10:21.250 --> 00:10:25.370
If you keep using Shamiko's body like that,
it's only going to cause her pain later.

00:10:25.620 --> 00:10:27.330
S-stay back!

00:10:28.250 --> 00:10:30.500
I have to find a place to hide and regroup!

00:10:31.580 --> 00:10:35.120
So, am I right to assume you won't be able
to get very far without this?

00:10:35.330 --> 00:10:38.370
Cease, commoner! How dare you pierce
my magnificent statue! Give that back!

00:10:38.370 --> 00:10:40.160
Sorry, don't take it personally.

00:10:40.160 --> 00:10:42.450
We prefer the regular old Shami over you.

00:10:42.450 --> 00:10:43.410
Curse you!

00:10:46.000 --> 00:10:48.750
Don't... Don't tell me...!

00:10:49.160 --> 00:10:52.370
Shamicen Eradication Attack!

00:10:54.540 --> 00:10:56.580
She's going to throw me with all her might?

00:10:57.330 --> 00:11:00.700
Do... Do I get one last wish before I die?

00:11:00.700 --> 00:11:02.080
She gives up way too fast!

00:11:09.580 --> 00:11:12.790
Where am I? What happened?!

00:11:14.330 --> 00:11:17.290
What is this?! What is this?! What is this?! What is THIS?!

00:11:17.540 --> 00:11:19.370
This is the Tama Health Spa.

00:11:19.370 --> 00:11:21.870
We came here to fulfill your ancestor's last wish.

00:11:21.870 --> 00:11:23.330
It's a hot spring paradise.

00:11:23.330 --> 00:11:24.950
Oh, Momo is still alive.

00:11:24.950 --> 00:11:27.660
Does that mean my ancestor lost?

00:11:27.870 --> 00:11:29.250
Did she put up an awesome fight?!

00:11:29.250 --> 00:11:31.080
Yep, she sure did.

00:11:31.080 --> 00:11:32.450
That's great.

00:11:34.500 --> 00:11:36.410
Gah... my whole body is sore.

00:11:36.410 --> 00:11:38.660
Your ancestor pushed your body pretty hard.

00:11:39.250 --> 00:11:40.290
You can have this back now.

00:11:40.500 --> 00:11:45.330
It's still too early for your body to take the strain,
so I blocked off the switch with some epoxy adhesive.

00:11:45.330 --> 00:11:47.080
What the heck is "epoxy"?

00:11:46.040 --> 00:11:48.620
Also, Ms. Lilith had a message for you.

00:11:48.870 --> 00:11:52.830
Don't think this means you've won!
But tell Shamiko that I'm sorry!

00:11:53.580 --> 00:11:56.450
She said something about coming back
after considering a new method of attack.

00:11:56.450 --> 00:11:59.620
Oh, so my ancestor's name is Lilith?

00:12:00.370 --> 00:12:01.250
By the way...

00:12:01.410 --> 00:12:03.200
Receipt
Ms. Shadow Mistress Yuko
$17.20 (1,720 yen)
Charges for last wish
Tama Health Spa

00:12:03.200 --> 00:12:07.540
She didn't have any cash to pay for the spa,
so she asked that I add it to your debt, Shamiko.

00:12:08.950 --> 00:12:21.000
Tama Health Spa

00:12:09.160 --> 00:12:12.160
Now that you're awake,
how about you go get in the hot springs?

00:12:12.160 --> 00:12:14.450
I'm going right now! I'm going to get my money's worth!

00:12:14.620 --> 00:12:20.450
Don't give up, Shamiko! When your body feels sore,
that's the time to drink milk and build muscle!

00:12:32.000 --> 00:12:36.660
I owed her $4.50 for the train fare,
and now another $17.20 for the spa.

00:12:36.660 --> 00:12:39.580
But she's renting me this spare school uniform for free.

00:12:40.700 --> 00:12:41.790
What's wrong?

00:12:41.790 --> 00:12:45.120
My debt to Momo more than tripled
after what happened the other day.

00:12:45.330 --> 00:12:50.580
Yeah, it really snowballed out of control. This happens
every time you fall for one of Momo Chiyo's tricks.

00:12:50.950 --> 00:12:53.040
You've gone totally snowballistic!

00:12:51.330 --> 00:12:54.870
Debt

00:12:53.040 --> 00:12:54.750
"Snowballistic"?!

00:12:54.950 --> 00:12:58.330
At first, I was experiencing a fiery bankruption
but now I'm totally snowballistic...

00:12:58.330 --> 00:12:59.950
...I'm both burning and freezing.

00:12:59.950 --> 00:13:03.660
If you ask me, the best option is just to pay
it all back in one go. Don't you think?

00:13:03.660 --> 00:13:04.330
Huh?

00:13:05.580 --> 00:13:10.160
Just between you and me, I know a great job
that can earn big bucks in just one day.

00:13:05.870 --> 00:13:11.450
Shopping Center Maruma
Food Staff Wanted!!

00:13:10.160 --> 00:13:11.450
You're freaking me out.

00:13:11.870 --> 00:13:12.950
Hey, Mom!

00:13:12.950 --> 00:13:15.450
Can I work a temp job for just one day on the weekend?

00:13:15.700 --> 00:13:18.000
At this rate I'm going to be snowballistic for life!

00:13:18.200 --> 00:13:19.870
"Snowballistic"?

00:13:19.870 --> 00:13:23.040
Well, I don't mind so long as you
got permission from the school.

00:13:23.450 --> 00:13:26.410
But don't forget about the curse of the Light Clan.

00:13:26.790 --> 00:13:27.750
You mean...

00:13:28.200 --> 00:13:32.080
"The Yoshida family is cursed
to survive on only $400 a month."

00:13:32.790 --> 00:13:35.950
Any money that's saved over that amount
is fated to slip right out of our hands.

00:13:36.540 --> 00:13:39.160
Congratulations
Congratulations
Congratulations

00:13:37.080 --> 00:13:39.160
Like when I have to send congratulatory money
to friends who suddenly got married.

00:13:39.160 --> 00:13:42.870
Donation Box

00:13:39.580 --> 00:13:42.870
Or when I throw some change into a donation box and
accidentally end up throwing my whole purse instead.

00:13:43.290 --> 00:13:45.200
Or when my purse falls straight into the gutter.

00:13:45.200 --> 00:13:47.830
More than half of those are just you being a klutz, mom...

00:13:48.250 --> 00:13:53.290
When a huge bird snatched a paycheck straight
out my hands, I have to admit I laughed a little.

00:13:53.290 --> 00:13:54.250
A bird?!

00:13:54.830 --> 00:13:56.330
I sobbed afterwards, though.

00:13:56.910 --> 00:14:00.160
But we've managed to survive oddly well
on only $400 a month.

00:14:00.160 --> 00:14:02.540
Especially since Sis and I both go to school.

00:14:02.540 --> 00:14:06.750
My body is really frail, so I end up
going to the hospital a lot, too.

00:14:06.750 --> 00:14:10.750
Medical bills, school bills, and heating bills
are all exceptions that I can save extra money for.

00:14:10.750 --> 00:14:12.200
This curse is oddly specific!

00:14:12.750 --> 00:14:17.000
I'd really like to meet the Magical Girl
who came up with such a ridiculous idea!

00:14:17.870 --> 00:14:21.500
Anyway, the point is that if you save up too much money,
then it will find a way to disappear,

00:14:21.500 --> 00:14:23.500
so don't get too greedy with work.

00:14:24.000 --> 00:14:32.950
A few days later

00:14:24.250 --> 00:14:25.500
If you can just pay back your debt

00:14:25.500 --> 00:14:27.620
and make progress with your goals,

00:14:27.620 --> 00:14:29.580
I think that would be for the best.

00:14:33.120 --> 00:14:35.910
MARUMA'S MEATS

00:14:33.450 --> 00:14:35.910
I've gotta protect my cash and watch out for birds!

00:14:35.910 --> 00:14:38.620
We're selling pork, not chicken, Shamiko.

00:14:38.790 --> 00:14:41.830
Today I'm going to have you help me
by passing out some wiener samples.

00:14:41.830 --> 00:14:42.870
Okay.

00:14:44.160 --> 00:14:47.950
You really do have horns coming out of your head!
Just like Anri said!

00:14:48.500 --> 00:14:51.370
But you know, this is just a normal job.
Are you okay with that?

00:14:51.540 --> 00:14:53.750
Are you sure you wouldn't prefer
something more sinister?

00:14:53.750 --> 00:14:54.450
Huh?

00:14:54.830 --> 00:14:55.950
Anri told me...

00:14:55.950 --> 00:14:58.660
The daughter of a distinguished family of darkness
has suffered a blow from her mortal enemy,

00:14:58.660 --> 00:15:03.580
she was tricked into a monetary debt
comparable to the budget of a small city.

00:15:04.200 --> 00:15:05.370
At least, that's what I heard.

00:15:05.750 --> 00:15:07.250
My family is undistinguished, if anything!

00:15:07.250 --> 00:15:09.040
Anri really embellished the story way too much!

00:15:09.080 --> 00:15:12.160
Extra
Serving

00:15:09.660 --> 00:15:11.200
I laid it on extra thick!

00:15:14.120 --> 00:15:15.910
Listen closely, Shamiko.

00:15:15.910 --> 00:15:19.160
If you cut the wieners like this and fry them up...

00:15:19.700 --> 00:15:20.750
Ta-da!

00:15:20.750 --> 00:15:22.500
They become little octopuses!

00:15:23.080 --> 00:15:25.000
I-Is this magic?

00:15:26.160 --> 00:15:28.080
You're such a sillybilly, Shamiko!

00:15:28.080 --> 00:15:30.080
While we've got the chance, do you want to taste test?

00:15:30.080 --> 00:15:31.410
Can I really?

00:15:31.410 --> 00:15:32.660
Thank you so much!

00:15:32.870 --> 00:15:34.750
These are garlic flavor.

00:15:34.750 --> 00:15:37.870
And what you've got is the basil lemon flavor.
Do your best to promote them, okay?

00:15:37.870 --> 00:15:39.620
What's a "basil" anyway?

00:15:42.790 --> 00:15:44.330
Whoa! Yummy!

00:15:44.330 --> 00:15:45.620
How can something be so delicious?!

00:15:45.620 --> 00:15:47.330
How can something be so fresh?!

00:15:47.330 --> 00:15:48.410
It's so salty and sour!

00:15:48.410 --> 00:15:49.750
Out of this world!

00:15:49.750 --> 00:15:51.410
I'm gonna work super hard!

00:15:52.660 --> 00:15:53.620
For now...

00:15:53.870 --> 00:15:58.160
I'll work hard to repay my debt, then challenge Momo
and undo the seal on my ancestor!

00:15:58.540 --> 00:16:00.790
Then after that... uh...

00:16:00.790 --> 00:16:01.700
Huh?

00:16:02.660 --> 00:16:06.540
What exactly do I want to do
once I defeat a Magical Girl?

00:16:06.750 --> 00:16:08.910
I'd never really considered it up until now.

00:16:09.620 --> 00:16:11.450
Shamiko, you're doing great work!

00:16:11.450 --> 00:16:11.950
Huh?

00:16:12.040 --> 00:16:15.500
If we make good sales today, then I'll let you
take a bag of wieners home with you.

00:16:15.500 --> 00:16:16.040
Really?!

00:16:16.250 --> 00:16:18.660
Okay, I'll be in the back if you need me.

00:16:19.370 --> 00:16:22.830
Once I beat the Magical Girl, I'll sell more wieners.

00:16:23.330 --> 00:16:26.580
I'll release the seal,
then sell wieners and get more to take home!

00:16:26.580 --> 00:16:28.580
Sell some, then take some home!

00:16:28.580 --> 00:16:30.620
Sell some, then take some home!

00:16:30.620 --> 00:16:36.580
Sell some, then take some home...!
Sell some, then take some home...!

00:16:36.580 --> 00:16:37.500
What're you doing?

00:16:37.500 --> 00:16:38.950
Oh! A customer!

00:16:39.580 --> 00:16:42.290
Help yourself to a free sample of the super,
ultra-yummy wieners we're selling!

00:16:44.410 --> 00:16:45.540
Momo...?

00:16:46.160 --> 00:16:47.250
Thanks.

00:16:48.200 --> 00:16:48.870
Ga...

00:16:49.370 --> 00:16:50.910
Gaaaaah!

00:16:50.910 --> 00:16:53.250
Momo! What are you doing?!

00:16:53.870 --> 00:16:57.870
Sorry, after I bit into it,
I realized that one wasn't quite ready.

00:16:59.870 --> 00:17:02.370
So, what exactly are you doing here Shamiko?

00:17:02.540 --> 00:17:05.620
I'm working hard to pay back all the money I owe you.

00:17:05.620 --> 00:17:07.950
Normally you're my mortal enemy,
but today you're a customer.

00:17:07.950 --> 00:17:09.370
Please try one of our samples.

00:17:09.370 --> 00:17:11.950
I recommend the basil lemon flavor!

00:17:11.950 --> 00:17:14.750
Wow, I'm impressed that you actually
know what basil is, Shamiko.

00:17:14.750 --> 00:17:15.830
That's rude!

00:17:15.830 --> 00:17:17.290
Of course, I know what basil is!

00:17:18.330 --> 00:17:20.080
Where does basil comes from?

00:17:20.080 --> 00:17:22.080
Well... it's an edible plant.

00:17:22.540 --> 00:17:24.540
It's one of those plants you can eat, right?

00:17:25.160 --> 00:17:26.620
You're not wrong, but...

00:17:26.620 --> 00:17:28.290
Why are you making that face?!

00:17:28.910 --> 00:17:31.200
What about you, Momo? Did you come to shop?

00:17:31.200 --> 00:17:36.160
Great deal!!
Minced meat
$5.34 (534 yen)

00:17:31.870 --> 00:17:34.250
Minced meat and... canned food?

00:17:34.250 --> 00:17:36.160
Don't get hung up on details like that.

00:17:36.160 --> 00:17:38.910
But this is amazing. You're so admirable, Shamiko!

00:17:38.910 --> 00:17:39.750
Huh?

00:17:39.750 --> 00:17:43.750
Even though you've awakened as a Demon Girl,
you've remained calm and collected.

00:17:44.330 --> 00:17:48.200
Doing proper work in order to pay back your debt,
it's almost too pure.

00:17:48.200 --> 00:17:50.370
Aren't you setting the bar a little low there?!

00:17:50.790 --> 00:17:56.080
You haven't tried to rob any banks,
or even brainwash one of the world's billionaires.

00:17:56.080 --> 00:17:58.120
I'd never do anything like that!

00:17:58.120 --> 00:18:00.540
What kind of crazy things
did you get caught up in before we met?!

00:18:00.700 --> 00:18:02.330
B-but that's not all!

00:18:02.500 --> 00:18:06.700
I'm selling these wieners
to pay you back and then after that...

00:18:07.330 --> 00:18:09.620
I'm going to fight with you...!

00:18:15.080 --> 00:18:38.160
Seconds

00:18:34.790 --> 00:18:37.870
0.0080 Seconds! She just set a new personal best!

00:18:38.410 --> 00:18:40.790
Oh no, not the cute little octopuses!

00:18:45.370 --> 00:18:46.290
Huh?

00:18:49.080 --> 00:18:53.750
But how? All the octopuses are arranged on the plate
with a clean toothpick sticking out of each one!

00:18:55.580 --> 00:18:57.700
Somehow, I managed to get them all
without dropping a single one.

00:19:05.790 --> 00:19:07.370
You transformed?!

00:19:07.370 --> 00:19:09.120
Uh, yeah...

00:19:11.330 --> 00:19:12.950
You didn't burn yourself or anything, right?

00:19:12.950 --> 00:19:14.040
I'm fine!

00:19:14.040 --> 00:19:17.250
But why did you choose right now to transform?

00:19:17.250 --> 00:19:20.200
You didn't even transform when I was beating up on you!

00:19:21.200 --> 00:19:25.790
To be honest... I don't have very fond memories
of my time as a Magical Girl.

00:19:26.120 --> 00:19:27.910
So I've avoided transforming as much as I can.

00:19:29.410 --> 00:19:30.410
But...

00:19:30.660 --> 00:19:33.830
I didn't want to see all of your hard work
go to waste just now.

00:19:37.000 --> 00:19:38.160
Momo...

00:19:41.080 --> 00:19:44.580
Considering the limits of my current power,
your punches are totally negligible,

00:19:44.580 --> 00:19:48.450
but I definitely couldn't handle
all of those octopuses without transforming.

00:19:48.750 --> 00:19:49.700
Huh?

00:19:49.700 --> 00:19:52.700
Did I just hear you drop
a totally unnecessary comment in there?

00:19:55.040 --> 00:19:58.450
As the octopuses fell to the ground,
I had to stab them all with a toothpick individually

00:19:58.450 --> 00:20:00.450
and then make sure they made it safely onto a new plate.

00:20:00.660 --> 00:20:08.790
Super Slow

00:20:01.750 --> 00:20:04.910
It's the first time I've ever performed movements
so quick and complicated.

00:20:05.160 --> 00:20:08.790
In the past, I was the type who just
bulldozed everything down with force...

00:20:10.120 --> 00:20:15.660
I feel like I entered into a zone that I was never able
to even see back when I was in active service.

00:20:16.620 --> 00:20:19.160
This whole experience has made me stronger somehow!

00:20:21.120 --> 00:20:22.790
Thank you, Shamiko!

00:20:23.200 --> 00:20:25.540
Is... Is that so?

00:20:26.540 --> 00:20:27.660
A "zone," huh?

00:20:34.080 --> 00:20:37.000
She just became even harder for me to beat...

00:20:39.830 --> 00:20:42.290
Juicy Delicious Wieners
Basil Flavor
Juicy Delicious Wieners
Garlic Flavor

00:20:40.790 --> 00:20:42.290
I'm going to buy some of your wieners.

00:20:42.290 --> 00:20:45.080
Uh, are you sure you want to buy that many?

00:20:45.370 --> 00:20:47.410
Yeah. They were yummy.

00:20:52.700 --> 00:20:53.790
Momo!

00:20:55.290 --> 00:20:57.000
Don't think this means...!

00:20:57.750 --> 00:20:59.790
No, that's not what I want to say.

00:21:03.000 --> 00:21:04.540
Thank you very much.

00:21:06.950 --> 00:21:08.370
Right back at you.

00:21:13.540 --> 00:21:15.620
Amazing work today, Shamiko!

00:21:15.620 --> 00:21:18.330
Our sales were through the roof!

00:21:18.330 --> 00:21:20.200
Wow, really?

00:21:20.200 --> 00:21:21.700
But I'm sorry...

00:21:21.700 --> 00:21:22.200
Why?

00:21:22.200 --> 00:21:26.410
We sold so many that there aren't
any wieners left for me to give you to take home!

00:21:26.750 --> 00:21:27.620
Huh?

00:21:28.620 --> 00:21:30.870
PLAIN
YOGURT

00:21:28.790 --> 00:21:30.750
I'll give you these instead, okay?

00:21:34.040 --> 00:21:39.000
PLAIN
YOGURT

00:21:34.700 --> 00:21:37.370
Curse you, Momo!

00:21:37.370 --> 00:21:39.040
Curses!

00:21:39.040 --> 00:21:41.370
Wh-what's wrong?

00:21:41.870 --> 00:21:45.830
Don't think this means you've won!

00:21:45.830 --> 00:21:50.450
Don't give up, Shamiko! That yogurt is also yummy,
but in a completely different sense!

00:21:51.080 --> 00:21:53.330
Curse you, Momo!

00:21:53.330 --> 00:21:56.580
I curse you!

00:21:56.580 --> 00:21:58.620
Momo Chiyoda, eh?

00:22:00.000 --> 00:22:00.870
COLA
FRUITTY MILK
PLAIN YOGURT

00:22:01.080 --> 00:22:05.120
Don't think this means you've won!
But tell Shamiko that I'm sorry!

00:22:05.200 --> 00:22:06.200
COLA
FRUITTY MILK
PLAIN YOGURT

00:22:06.370 --> 00:22:09.410
Well, she doesn't seem like such a bad rival.

00:22:14.250 --> 00:22:17.120
Oh! They're covering the Beppu Hot Springs today!

00:22:17.120 --> 00:22:20.500
I'm jealous! I'd love to visit the Hells of Beppu!

00:22:22.450 --> 00:22:33.950
The Demon Girl Next Door

00:23:50.950 --> 00:24:06.000
Preview

00:23:51.410 --> 00:23:52.500
Hi, I'm Ryoko Yoshida.

00:23:52.500 --> 00:23:56.830
In the next episode, I receive an amazing item
from my big sister Yuko's best friend, Momo.

00:23:56.830 --> 00:23:58.200
Shamiko, she called me your "best friend."

00:23:58.200 --> 00:23:59.950
Please just go along with it for now!

00:23:59.950 --> 00:24:02.290
Shamiko's got more than one best friend!
Don't forget about me, Anri!

00:24:02.290 --> 00:24:06.000
A Towl Full of Traps?! The Demon on the Brink Awakens a New Ability

00:24:02.330 --> 00:24:03.450
I'm Sion Ogura.

00:24:03.450 --> 00:24:05.870
I've always wanted to have a close
and personal chat with Shamiko!
